WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.365
Welcome to the Ticket-to-Machine
Reference, Appendix B of Governance,

2
00:00:04.365 --> 00:00:08.075
Drift and Evidence, in the
Federal Modernization Workbook.

3
00:00:08.075 --> 00:00:11.423
Chapter 10 makes an argument
about operational tempo;

4
00:00:11.423 --> 00:00:14.325
this appendix is the
reference that backs it up.

5
00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:17.208
Over the next twelve
minutes we'll walk the loop,

6
00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:22.162
the five clauses every change passes through,
the lanes each kind of change takes,

7
00:00:22.162 --> 00:00:25.637
the clocks, the evidence record,
and four worked examples.

8
00:00:25.637 --> 00:00:30.234
One caution up front: the lanes,
ceilings, severities and windows are the

9
00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:35.299
program's design, not federal requirements,
and the examples are illustrative.

10
00:00:35.299 --> 00:00:37.580
Let's start with why any of this matters.
